   217	    """
   218	    Reassemble scattered hollow frames into a left-right symmetric perforated rectangle,
   219	    then collapse every frame to the outer border's color.
   220	
   221	    Input structure:
   222	    - `bg` is the most common color; every non-bg component is a single-color rectangular
   223	      ring with a background hole.
   224	    - The unique largest ring is the outer border. Smaller rings are scattered elsewhere
   225	      and appear either once on the center line or twice as a mirrored side-pair.
   226	
